  "description": "Where does your bike take you? Sometimes it's about the destination, other times it's about how you get there. The Del Sol Soulville DLX with it's classic twin top tube steel frame was designed with both in mind. A 650b wheel-set together with a Shimano Nexus internal 3-speed drive-train, Shimano hydraulic disc brakes, color matched fenders and a front rack will push all the style, performance and cycling relaxation you can handle.\nD-Street Cafe twin top tube steel urban frameset\nForged Alloy 3 Piece, bolt-on 38t chainring\nComfort alloy handlebar with 180mm length quill stem\nSpringer comfort saddle\nDouble-wall Alloy rims with stainless steel spokes\nShimano Nexus 3-spd rear hub with Shimano Revo twist shifter\nShimano MT200 hydraulic disc brakes\nFull coverage fenders and front rack",
